# PulseAudio user config (t490). Loads the system default, then forces the
# onboard card onto the speakers+mic profile at every start.
#
# Why: module-card-restore brings back the last-used profile even when it's an
# HDMI output that is no longer plugged in (undocked reboot 2026-09-18 → all
# audio went to a dead HDMI sink). module-switch-on-port-available (loaded by
# the system default.pa) still hops to HDMI when the dock monitor appears and
# back to analog when it disappears — this only fixes the starting point.
.include /etc/pulse/default.pa

.nofail
set-card-profile alsa_card.pci-0000_00_1f.3 output:analog-stereo+input:analog-stereo
